WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.120
keep the left hand clear until the right hand releases the object inside the basket.

2
00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.260
move the left gripper toward the basket handle.

3
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:25.620
keep the left arm still until the other arm clears its path.

4
00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.840
move the left gripper toward the basket handle.

5
00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.820
grasp the basket with the left gripper.

6
00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:30.231
lift the basket containing the object.

